# Terraform state, caches and plans
**/.terraform/
**/terraform.tfstate
**/terraform.tfstate.*
**/*.tfstate
**/*.tfstate.*
**/*.tfplan
**/*.tfplan.*
**/tfplan
**/*.plan
**/terraform.tfstate.d/
**/crash.log
**/crash.*.log
**/override.tf
**/override.tf.json
**/*_override.tf
**/*_override.tf.json

# Local inputs, credentials and secrets
**/*.tfvars
**/*.tfvars.json
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/credentials
**/secrets.*

# Commit .terraform.lock.hcl for reproducible provider selections.

